       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "title": "Read the full Demo Patch Notes #4 below",
     "items": [
      {
       "text": "A-lot of combat flow improvements",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "New Blessing added at the end of the level",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "new"
      },
      {
       "text": "Adjustments to the insanity gameplay effects",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Combat camera adjustments",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Quite a ton of bugs squashed",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Morio combat flow improvements on both phases",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Grom combat flow and animation improvements",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Improvements on some sound effects",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Small lighting adjustments",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Small UI improvements and fixes",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Small optimizations done throughout the demo",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "For Dualshock 4 & 5 users - you can now activate the option to use your PS4 & PS5 controllers work with Morbid: The Lords of Ire on Steam! In the settings menu on the Game Hub page, simply select 'Controller' and set the overide setting for Morbid to 'Enable Steam Input'.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other",
       "platforms": [
        "ps5",
        "pc"
       ]
      },
      {
       "text": "Thank you for all the amazing feedback on this demo! We hope you have enjoyed battling through the fearsome enemies of Rimehold so far, and hope that this new patch helps improve your experience!",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Have you defeated the fearsome Morio, the Man-Eater yet? If not, then the time is now - pick up your Sword of Dibrom and start on your perilous path that lies before you, Striver...",
