    },
    {
     "title": "Read the full Demo Patch Notes #2 below",
     "items": [
      {
       "text": "Updates and improvements on the inventory UI",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "XP Multiplier no longer gets reset when meditating on a Shrine",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Pesky ladders have been tamed (they should no-longer kill the player)",
