       "text": "Magratheus blesses you with a new range of fixes in our latest patch for the Morbid: The Lords of Ire Demo.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "title": "Read the full patch notes below",
     "items": [
      {
       "text": "Improved sprinting feel",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "new"
